WEBVTT

NOTE Narration by an AI voice: Matilda (XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX), eleven_v4.

intro
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.180
An employee forwards a suspicious invoice to the security inbox. Cursor CLI takes it from here.

ask
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.400
The analyst asks Cursor to read Dana's report and have the Splunk agent triage it.

outlook
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.120
Dana's report is on the right, in Outlook.

read
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Cursor reads it through the Outlook MCP and pulls out the original sender and link.

launch
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:33.080
Then it starts the Agent Launchpad triage agent in Splunk. The agent runs its own searches.

sources
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.220
It checks mail, proxy, endpoint, and sign-in data.

recipients
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.640
Fourteen people got the email. It failed SPF and DMARC, from a brand-new domain.

clicks
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:55.040
Three people clicked. Priya submitted the form, and later someone tried her account from the Netherlands. MFA stopped it.

contain-ask
00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:00.040
Now the analyst asks Cursor to contain it with n8n.

mailboxes
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.420
Cursor finds all fourteen mailboxes and calls the containment command.

why-stop
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:13.460
The command holds the run. Cursor shows exactly what will happen and waits for your approval.

approved
00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.040
Approved. Cursor reruns the command once.

n8n
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:28.000
n8n purges the email everywhere, blocks the sender's domain, and tells the analyst in Slack.

follow-up
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.080
Cursor flags the three people who clicked for follow-up.

verify-ask
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.940
The notice is in Slack. Now the same agent verifies it in Splunk.

verify-run
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:44.280
It checks every mailbox, and any activity since containment.

verified
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:51.520
No mailbox still holds it, and nothing touched the domain since. Containment is complete.

outro
00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.700
One approval, and a verified fix.
